WEBVTT

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:05.458
In this exercise, we will be working the hamstrings very heavily.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:11.083
What we are going to do, is begin by putting the ball under our legs and laying flat on our back.

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:13.416
So, support the abs.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:15.166
Close the ribcage.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:19.583
Curl down to come flat on your back and bring the ball under your legs.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:22.958
From here, extend the ball out to ninety degrees.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:26.541
Now, you want your feet kind of on the side of the ball.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:30.000
We are going to go ahead and bridge up in one move.

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:35.250
Rather than articulate the spine.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.666
So, take a nice inhale.

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:36.375
Exhale.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.208
Close the ribcage and come up.

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:41.375
Inhale.

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.708
Hold.

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:42.833
Exhale.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.208
Push the ball out.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.416
Inhale.

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.958
Bring it in and come down.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.750
Exhale.

00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:52.416
Up.

00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:54.125
Inhale.

00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:54.708
Hold.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.000
Exhale.

00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:55.541
Out.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.958
Inhale.

00:00:56.166 --> 00:01:00.000
In.

00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:03.291
And, exhale down.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:23.833
Now, this exercise can be advanced by doing it with just one leg.
